      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MACBETH.\nGo prick thy face and over-red thy fear,\nThou lily-liver’d boy. What soldiers, patch?\nDeath of thy soul! those linen cheeks of thine\nAre counsellors to fear. What soldiers, whey-face?",
