      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MACBETH.\nI’ll put it on.\nSend out more horses, skirr the country round;\nHang those that talk of fear. Give me mine armour.—\nHow does your patient, doctor?",
